  "description": "XIVZUY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H96 N50 O40 Tb4 2+,4(H3 O1 1+),6(Cl1 1-),40(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.695-3.881 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.43-111.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H188Cl6N50O84Tb4.",
